# data/ : keep folder structure, exclude heavy image + model binaries.
# Datasets live on disk and in the external backup; they are not committed to Git.

# Image content
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.webp

# Model weights / archives
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.bin
*.zip

# Always keep structure / this file
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
